<title>USA: Concurrent Computer Q4 net loss w/charge.</title>
<headline>Concurrent Computer Q4 net loss w/charge.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>			   CONCURRENT COMPUTER CORP</p>
<p>	   (Dollars in thousands except earnings per share)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>				Jun 30,  Jun 30,    Jun 30,   Jun 30,</p>
<p>				  1996	1995	1996	1995</p>
<p>Net Sales</p>
<p>  Computer systems	$ 6,734  $14,202    $42,430   $72,074</p>
<p>  Service and other	11,958   16,304     53,370    68,070</p>
<p>Total sales		  18,692   30,506     95,800   140,144</p>
<p> Net income (loss)    ( 34,056)	265  ( 39,712)  ( 2,006)</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>  per share		 ( 1.10)     0.01    ( 1.30)   ( 0.07)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 net included $29 million charge for restructuring and the write down of inventory and other assets in conjunction with the purchase of the real-time business of Harris Computer Systems Corp, which was  completed on June 27.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
